      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We estimate that the net proceeds to us from the sale of the notes will be approximately \u20ac\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003 (or approximately\n$\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003 using the closing euro/U.S. dollar exchange on November\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003, 2026 of \u20ac1.00 = $\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003, as quoted by Bloomberg L.P.), after deducting the underwriting discount and our\noffering expenses. We intend to use the net proceeds from this offering for general corporate purposes, which may include the repayment\nof other indebtedness (which could include the repayment of a portion of the \u20ac500\u00a0million outstanding aggregate principal amount of our 2.425% notes due 2026 (the \u201c 2026 notes \u201d) and/or the repayment of a portion of the\n$600\u00a0million outstanding aggregate principal amount of our 4.700% notes due 2027 (the \u201c 2027 notes \u201d)), share repurchases, financing capital commitments and financing acquisitions. We may, including in the near term, also\npursue one or more addi",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
